msgid "Deepglot language switcher"
msgstr "Deepglot Prepínač jazyka"

#: includes/Admin/NavMenuMetaBox.php:41
msgid "Adds a language switch entry that automatically expands into one entry per language when viewed."
msgstr "Pridá položku prepínania jazykov, ktorá sa pri prezeraní automaticky rozšíri na jednu položku pre každý jazyk."

#: includes/Admin/NavMenuMetaBox.php:44
msgid "Display mode"
msgstr "Režim zobrazenia"

#: includes/Admin/NavMenuMetaBox.php:49
msgid "List (each language as a separate menu item)"
msgstr "Zoznam (každý jazyk ako samostatná položka ponuky)"

#: includes/Admin/NavMenuMetaBox.php:55
msgid "Dropdown (active language as parent, alternatives as submenu)"
msgstr "Rozbaľovacia ponuka (aktívny jazyk ako rodič, alternatívy ako podponuka)"

#: includes/Admin/NavMenuMetaBox.php:61
msgid "Hide active language from the list"
msgstr "Skryť aktívny jazyk zo zoznamu"

#: includes/Admin/NavMenuMetaBox.php:71
msgid "Add to menu"
msgstr "Pridať do menu"

#: includes/Admin/NavMenuMetaBox.php:98
#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1341
#: includes/Config/SwitcherTemplates.php:115
msgid "Language switcher"
msgstr "Hlasový spínač"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:65
msgid "The URL preview is ready. Check the selection and then confirm the start."
msgstr "Ukážka URL je pripravená. Skontrolujte výber a potom potvrďte spustenie."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:87
msgid "URL synchronization has started."
msgstr "Synchronizácia URL sa začala."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:103
msgid "Invalid action."
msgstr "Neplatná akcia."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:110
msgid "The status of the URL synchronization has been updated."
msgstr "Stav synchronizácie URL bol aktualizovaný."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:111
msgid "The URL synchronization could not be changed in its current state."
msgstr "Synchronizáciu URL nebolo možné zmeniť v aktuálnom stave."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:118
#: includes/Api/RestApi.php:474
msgid "You need administrator rights for this action."
msgstr "Pre túto akciu potrebujete administrátorské práva."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:174
msgid "Deepglot: API key invalid or revoked."
msgstr "Deepglot: API-Key neplatné alebo odvolané."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:175
msgid "The Deepglot server rejects any translation request (HTTP 401). Content that has already been cached will continue to be delivered, but nothing new will be translated. Store a valid API key in the Deepglot settings, then it takes effect immediately."
msgstr "Server Deepglot odmietne akúkoľvek požiadavku na preklad (HTTP 401). Obsah, ktorý už bol uložený do vyrovnávacej pamäte, sa bude naďalej doručovať, ale nebude sa prekladať nič nové. Uložte platný API-Key do nastavení Deepglot, potom sa prejaví okamžite."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:177
msgid "Check API key in the Deepglot dashboard"
msgstr "Skontrolujte API-Key na hlavnom paneli Deepglot"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:204
msgid "Deepglot: Monthly word limit reached."
msgstr "Deepglot: Bol dosiahnutý mesačný limit slov."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:205
msgid "Content that has already been translated will continue to be delivered, but new or changed text will remain in the source language until the quota is reset or increased."
msgstr "Obsah, ktorý už bol preložený, sa bude naďalej doručovať, ale nový alebo zmenený text zostane v zdrojovom jazyku, kým sa kvóta nevynuluje alebo nezvýši."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:207
msgid "Check quota in the Deepglot dashboard"
msgstr "Skontrolujte kvótu na informačnom paneli Deepglot"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:385
msgid "Invalid API key"
msgstr "API-Key je neplatný"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:388
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktívne"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:391
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Zakázané"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:394
msgid "Setup required"
msgstr "Vyžaduje sa nastavenie"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:417
msgid "Welcome to Deepglot! Follow the three steps below to enable translation on your website."
msgstr "Vitajte v Deepglot! Ak chcete povoliť preklad na svojom webe, postupujte podľa troch krokov nižšie."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:428
msgid "Set up Deepglot"
msgstr "Nastaviť Deepglot"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:429
msgid "You only need an API key from the Deepglot dashboard. Setup takes less than two minutes."
msgstr "Všetko, čo potrebujete, je API-Key z hlavného panela Deepglot – trvá to menej ako dve minúty."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:441
msgid "Enter API key"
msgstr "Zadajte API-Key"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:444
msgid "The stored API key is rejected by the Deepglot server (HTTP 401). No new content is currently being translated - enter a valid key and save."
msgstr "Uložený API-Key server Deepglot odmietne (HTTP 401). Momentálne sa neprekladá žiadny nový obsah – zadajte platný kľúč a uložte."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:449
msgid "Create a free account on deepglot.ai, create a project for your website and copy the API key."
msgstr "Vytvorte si bezplatný účet na deepglot.ai, vytvorte projekt pre svoj web a skopírujte API-Key."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:452
msgid "Go to dashboard – create API key"
msgstr "Prejdite na informačný panel – vytvorte API-Key"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:457
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API-Key"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:468
msgid "You can find the full key under Settings → API keys in your Deepglot project."
msgstr "Úplný kľúč nájdete v časti Nastavenia → API-Keys vo svojom projekte Deepglot."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:472
msgid "Backend URL"
msgstr "Backend URL"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:480
msgid "Default: https://deepglot.ai/api – change only for self-hosting."
msgstr "Predvolená hodnota: https://deepglot.ai/api – zmena iba pre Self-Hosting."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:492
msgid "Configure languages"
msgstr "Konfigurovať jazyky"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:494
msgid "Specify the original language and the desired translation languages."
msgstr "Zadajte pôvodný jazyk a požadované jazyky prekladu."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:498
msgid "The source language, target languages, and automatic redirect are managed in the Deepglot dashboard and are only displayed here."
msgstr "Zdrojový jazyk, cieľové jazyky a automatické presmerovanie sa spravujú na ovládacom paneli Deepglot a tu sa iba zobrazujú."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:500
msgid "Open project settings"
msgstr "Otvoriť nastavenia projektu"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:506
msgid "Original language"
msgstr "Pôvodný jazyk"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:518
#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1275
msgid "Target languages"
msgstr "Cieľové jazyky"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:527
msgid "Comma-separated ISO 639-1 codes, such as en, fr, and it"
msgstr "Čiarkami oddelené ISO-639-1 kódy, napr. B. en, fr, it"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:539
msgid "Enable translation"
msgstr "Povoliť preklad"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:541
msgid "Once API key and languages are saved, enable automatic translation here."
msgstr "Po uložení API-Key a jazykov povoľte automatický preklad tu."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:553
msgid "Activate Deepglot for all frontend requests"
msgstr "Aktivujte Deepglot pre všetky požiadavky klientskeho rozhrania"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:558
msgid "Translation is enabled but stalled: the API key is rejected."
msgstr "Preklad je zapnutý, ale stojí: API-Key je odmietnutý."

#. translators: %1$s: source language, %2$s: target languages
#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:566
#, php-format
msgid "Active – pages are translated from %1$s to %2$s at /%3$s/your-page/"
msgstr "Aktívne – stránky sú preložené z %1$s do %2$s pod /%3$s/ihre-seite/"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:595
msgid "Automatically redirect visitors based on browser language (optional)"
msgstr "Automaticky presmerovať návštevníkov na základe jazyka prehliadača (voliteľné)"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:604
msgid "Hide advanced settings"
msgstr "Skryť rozšírené nastavenia"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:604
#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:605
msgid "Show advanced settings"
msgstr "Zobraziť rozšírené nastavenia"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:609
msgid "Excluded URLs"
msgstr "Vylúčené URLs"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:611
msgid "One URL or pattern per line."
msgstr "Jeden URL alebo vzor na riadok."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:614
msgid "Routing mode"
msgstr "Režim smerovania"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:617
msgid "Path prefix (/en/my-page)"
msgstr "Predpona cesty (/en/meine-seite)"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:620
msgid "Subdomains (en.example.com)"
msgstr "Subdomény (en.example.com)"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:623
msgid "Path prefix remains the default. For subdomains, each active target language needs a host."
msgstr "Predpona cesty zostáva predvolená. Pre subdomény potrebuje každý aktívny cieľový jazyk hostiteľa."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:626
msgid "Domain mappings"
msgstr "Mapovania domén"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:634
msgid "Format: language-code=host, one mapping per line."
msgstr "Formát: sprachcode=host, jedno priradenie na riadok."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:646
msgid "Translate WooCommerce and wp_mail emails"
msgstr "Prekladajte e-maily WooCommerce a wp_mail"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:659
msgid "Run searches in the visitor’s language"
msgstr "Vykonajte vyhľadávanie v jazyku návštevníka"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:672
msgid "Translate AMP pages"
msgstr "Preložiť stránky AMP"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:685
msgid "Translate dynamically loaded content (AJAX, infinite scroll, SPA)"
msgstr "Preklad dynamicky znovu načítaného obsahu (AJAX, nekonečné posúvanie, SPA)"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:689
msgid "Excluded CSS selectors"
msgstr "Vylúčené selektory CSS"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:691
msgid "One CSS class, ID or selector per line."
msgstr "Jedna trieda CSS, ID alebo selektor na riadok."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:725
msgid "Language switcher settings"
msgstr "Prepínač jazykov"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:726
msgid "How and where should the language switcher appear on your website?"
msgstr "Ako a kde by sa malo Language-Switcher zobraziť na vašej webovej lokalite?"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:739
msgid "Automatically add the language switcher to the page footer"
msgstr "Automaticky vložiť Switcher do päty strany"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:744
#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1356
msgid "Name"
msgstr "meno"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:749
#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1405
